WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.860
Gold breaks the low? Often it's just a sweep.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.670
Liquidity sweep: grab the stops, then turn.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.870
Sign one: a long wick below the low.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.470
Sign two: volume spikes.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.870
Sign three: a fast return above the low.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.670
Typical mistake: trading every wick.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.270
No time to analyze it yourself?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.120
I show setups like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
